{"id": "t08-247176", "status": "read", "groups": [{"levels": [[{"surface": "محمود بن غيلان", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "وكيع", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "سفيان", "kind": "narrator", "occurrence": 1}]]}, {"levels": [[{"surface": "عمرو بن علي", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "عبد الرحمن", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "سفيان", "kind": "narrator", "occurrence": 2}]]}], "shared_tail": [[{"surface": "منصور", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "هلال بن يساف", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "أبي يحيى", "kind": "narrator"}], [{"surface": "عبد الله بن عمرو", "kind": "narrator"}]], "needs_ruling": false, "notes": ["the two branches meet at Sufyan («ح»), and what is written once after the last «ح» («عن منصور ...») belongs to both, so it is the shared tail", "«- واللفظ له -» is an editor note, not a name", "the chain ends at a Companion; the saying («رأى رسول الله ...») is his narration"], "fixes": []}
